        },
        {
          "id": "f3",
          "label": "Intro paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Crowded, gapped or crooked teeth can affect how you feel about your smile and can make teeth harder to keep clean. Invisalign clear aligners offer a way to gradually straighten teeth using a series of removable, clear trays, without traditional metal brackets and wires."
        },
        {
          "id": "f4",
          "label": "Intro paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "At Precision Dental, we assess whether Invisalign is suitable for your teeth and bite, explain what treatment involves and help you understand the commitment required for successful results."
        },
        {
