roke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span></button></h3><div class=\"faq-a\" id=\"faq4\"><div><p>{{f10}}</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3 class=\"faq-h\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq5\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"q\">{{f11}}</span><span class=\"chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span></button></h3><div class=\"faq-a\" id=\"faq5\"><div><p>{{f12}}</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3 class=\"faq-h\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq6\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"q\">{{f13}}</span><span class=\"chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span></button></h3><div class=\"faq-a\" id=\"faq6\"><div><p>{{f14}}</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "f1",
          "label": "Small label",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "FAQ"
        },
        {
          "id": "f2",
          "label": "Heading",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Frequently Asked Questions"
        },
        {
          "id": "f3",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "How long does Invisalign treatment take?",
          "group": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "f4",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Treatment length varies depending on how much movement is needed. Some cases take a few months, while more involved cases take longer. We will give you an estimated timeframe at your consultation.",
          "group": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "f5",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Does Invisalign hurt?",
          "group": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "f6",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Most patients feel pressure or mild discomfort for a day or two when starting a new set of aligners. This is a sign the aligners are working and usually settles quickly.",
          "group": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "f7",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Can I eat and drink with my aligners in?",
          "group": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "f8",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Aligners should be removed when eating and when drinking anything other than plain water. Brush your teeth before putting them back in to help prevent staining and decay.",
          "group": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "f9",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Will people notice I am wearing aligners?",
          "group": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "f10",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Clear aligners are designed to be discreet, and many people may not notice them in everyday conversation. Attachments are tooth-coloured to blend in.",
          "group": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "f11",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Do I need to wear retainers afterwards?",
          "group": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "f12",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Yes. Retainers help maintain your result after treatment. Without them, teeth can gradually move back towards their original position.",
          "group": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "f13",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Is Invisalign covered by private health insurance?",
          "group": "6"
        },
        {
          "id": "f14",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Some extras policies with orthodontic cover provide a benefit for clear aligner treatment. We recommend checking with your fund, and we can provide item numbers to help.",
          "group": "6"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
